@startuml SEQ_10_MELIHAT_PERMOHONAN_PENGADAAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title SEQ-10 · Melihat Permohonan Pengadaan\nAktor: Dosen / Asisten

actor       "Dosen / Asisten"             as Actor
boundary    "Browser"                     as Browser
control     "PermohonanAsetController"    as Controller
entity      "PermohonanAset Model"        as ModelPA
database    "permohonan_aset"             as DB

note over Actor, DB : Policy: role 'dosen' atau 'asisten' – view-only, tidak ada aksi approve/reject

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Skenario A: Melihat Daftar Permohonan Pengadaan ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Actor   ->  Browser    : Buka menu Permohonan Pengadaan
Browser ->  Controller : GET /inventaris/permohonan\n[auth:sanctum | role:dosen,asisten]

activate Controller
Controller -> Controller : authorize: can('viewAny', PermohonanAset)\n(policy: izinkan dosen & asisten)

alt Tidak punya hak akses
    Controller --> Browser : 403 Forbidden
    Browser --> Actor      : Halaman "Akses Ditolak"
else Berhak melihat
    Controller -> ModelPA  : with(['items.kategoriAset','pengaju.profile','laboratorium'])\n.latest()->paginate()
    activate ModelPA
    ModelPA -> DB : SELECT permohonan_aset\n  JOIN users AS pengaju JOIN profile\n  JOIN laboratorium\n  JOIN permohonan_items, kategori_aset
    DB --> ModelPA : daftar permohonan
    ModelPA --> Controller : paginated list
    deactivate ModelPA

    Controller --> Browser : Inertia::render('Permohonan/Index', [\n  permohonan,\n  viewOnly: true\n])
    Browser     --> Actor  : Daftar permohonan pengadaan\n- Filter by: status, tanggal\n- Tombol "Lihat Detail" saja\n- Tidak ada tombol Setujui / Tolak
end
deactivate Controller

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Skenario B: Melihat Detail Permohonan ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Actor   ->  Browser    : Klik "Lihat Detail" pada salah satu permohonan
Browser ->  Controller : GET /inventaris/permohonan/{id}\n[auth:sanctum | role:dosen,asisten]

activate Controller
Controller -> Controller : authorize: can('view', permohonan)
Controller -> ModelPA    : findOrFail(id)\n->load(['items.kategoriAset','pengaju.profile',\n         'laboratorium','approvedBy.profile'])
activate ModelPA
ModelPA -> DB : SELECT permohonan_aset WHERE id=?\n  JOIN relasi terkait
DB --> ModelPA : detail permohonan
ModelPA --> Controller : permohonan lengkap
deactivate ModelPA

Controller --> Browser : Inertia::render('Permohonan/Show', [\n  permohonan,\n  viewOnly: true\n])
Browser     --> Actor  : Detail permohonan:\n- Info pengaju, lab, tanggal\n- Daftar item yang dimohonkan\n- Status saat ini (pending / disetujui / ditolak)\n- Alasan penolakan (jika ada)\n- Tidak ada aksi approve / reject
deactivate Controller

@enduml
